                "name": "Buffer",
                "message": "`Buffer` is the Node global, and it does not exist on Cloudflare Workers, which is why @cloudflare/workers-types declares it `any`: nothing read through it is checked. Use the byte helpers in @nexus/source/encoding/ByteEncoding instead: utf8ToBytes / bytesToUtf8, base64ToBytes / bytesToBase64, base64UrlToBytes / bytesToBase64Url, hexToBytes / bytesToHex, concatenateBytes, utf8ByteLength, byteView, and `new Uint8Array(length)` for Buffer.alloc. A Buffer a Node API hands back (readFileSync, cipher.update) is already typed; keep using it as the Uint8Array it is.."
            },
